330
00:22:15.623 --> 00:22:28.764
Related ADRs, ADR-300 Four clusters by loss tolerance (catalog, session, ratelimit, feature); ADR-301 Eviction: catalog allkeys-lfu, session noeviction,

331
00:22:29.044 --> 00:22:53.172
ratelimit volatile-ttl (L1); ADR-302 Pipelining or MGET mandatory for multi-key reads (L2); ADR-303 Redis Cluster + Lettuce; resharding runbook (L3); ADR-304 Durability: sessions or carts in PostgreSQL, cache rebuildable; WAIT 1 50 on cart writes (L4); ADR-305 Hot keys:

